# P19e Voxel Blend (UE UVoxelBlendMeshesTool / FVoxelBlendMeshesOp, Engine/Geometry/MeshVoxelOperations VoxBlend):
# two overlapping 100 cm Boxes from Modeling > Shapes (Box resting on the floor at 0,50,0, Box2 at 60,90,40 so the union has
# concave joints), each with the UV checker, Lit, camera close. Both selected -> VoxOps VoxBlend Union, Blend
# Falloff 20 cm, Voxel Count 64 (128 takes ~9 s, past the 240-frame settle limit) -> Accept (waits for the background compute) -> new entity "Box VoxBlend", inputs
# hidden -> Undo brings the two boxes back.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.6,-0.45,0.65
Дано run Modeling "Create shape pivot: Centre"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,50,0
Дано run Modeling "Attributes tool: Edit Materials"
Дано run Modeling "Edit Materials active slot: 0"
Дано run Modeling "Edit Materials slot material: M_UVChecker"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 60,90,40
Дано run Modeling "Attributes tool: Edit Materials"
Дано run Modeling "Edit Materials active slot: 0"
Дано run Modeling "Edit Materials slot material: M_UVChecker"
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Box2"
Дано run "Level Viewport" "Focus Selected"
Тогда-вид 0_inputs two overlapping checkered boxes, both selected, sharp joints between them
Когда run Modeling "VoxBlend operation: Union"
Когда run Modeling "VoxBlend inputs: Hide Inputs"
Когда --subject modeling set VoxBlend.VoxelCount 64
Когда --subject modeling set VoxBlend.BlendFalloff 20
Когда run Modeling "VoxOps tool: VoxBlend"
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Когда state
Тогда 0_blend one closed mesh "Box VoxBlend": the concave joints of the two boxes rounded by the blend (fillet), no holes; Box and Box2 hidden
Когда run Action Undo
Когда state
Тогда 1_undo the two separate checkered boxes back with sharp joints, no blended mesh
